effective_config.description:
Current effective operational settings:

- Configuration Precedence: {precedence}
- Resolved Storage Root: {media_root}
- Estimated Byte Rate: {rate_estimate}
- Watchdog Timeout Formula: {watchdog_formula}
- Hard Cap Safeguard: {hard_cap_behavior}
- Chunk Duration: {chunk_seconds}s
- Concurrency Limit: {max_parallel}
- Queue Capacity: {max_queue_depth} (timeout: {queue_timeout}s)
- Retention: {retention_size_mb} MB / {retention_days} days
- Disk Free Floor: {min_disk_free_mb} MB
- Configured Camera Profiles: {profiles_count}
- Auto-Association: {auto_association}

Known Limitations:
- Native lookback may reuse an active HLS buffer; best effort only
- Snapshot mode stores static still images only
- Storage admission failures return STORAGE_CAPACITY_EXCEEDED; only unsettled timed-out/cancelled writers are quarantined
- Visual UTC timestamps may remain unknown without calibrated provider clocks
- Storage root migration UI and grouped-card display deferred
